t;3rd Inning&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;long&quot;:&quot;4th Inning&quot;,&quot;short&quot;:&quot;4th Inning&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;long&quot;:&quot;5th Inning&quot;,&quot;short&quot;:&quot;5th Inning&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;long&quot;:&quot;6th Inning&quot;,&quot;short&quot;:&quot;6th Inning&quot;},&quot;23&quot;:{&quot;long&quot;:&quot;7th Inning&quot;,&quot;short&quot;:&quot;7th Inning&quot;},&quot;24&quot;:{&quot;long&quot;:&quot;8th Inning&quot;,&quot;short&quot;:&quot;8th Inning&quot;},&quot;25&quot;:{&quot;long&quot;:&quot;9th Inning&quot;,&quot;short&quot;:&quot;9th Inning&quot;},&quot;26&quot;:{&quot;long&quot;:&quot;Next Set&quot;,&quot;short&quot;:&quot;Next Set&quot;},&quot;27&quot;:{&quot;long&quot;:&quot;Current Set&quot;,&quot;short&quot;:&quot;Current Set&quot;},&quot;28&quot;:{&quot;long&quot;:&quot;Next Game&quot;,&quot;short&quot;:&quot;Next Game&quot;},&quot;29&quot;:{&quot;long&quot;:&quot;Current Game&quot;,&quot;short&quot;:&quot;Current Game&quot;}},&quot;scopeSportAllNames&quot;:{&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;long&quot;:&quot;1st Half Innings&quot;,&quot;short&quot;:&quot;1st Half Innings&quot;}},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;long&quot;:&quot;2nd Half Innings&quot;,&quot;short&quot;:&quot;2nd Half Innings&quot;}}}},&quot;myBookmakers&quot;:[129,264,141,160,997,909,1015],&quot;homeParticipantUrl&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;awayParticipantUrl&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;texts&quot;:{&quot;showMoreDetails&quot;:&quot;Show more details about&quot;,&quot;thereNoOddsAvailable&quot;:&quot;There are no odds available for this event.&quot;,&quot;loginToDisplayTheOdds&quot;:&quot;Log in to display the odds!&quot;,&quot;seoTexts&quot;:{&quot;eventMatchFactsText&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;Check out the current top trends for each team heading in this fixture, including any winning or losing runs for the teams involved, and whether you should expect goals or not from the encounter based on recent form.&lt;\\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;eventOverviewText&quot;:[&quot;&lt;p&gt;Compare the latest&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;text-decoration: underline;\\&quot;&gt;[SportName]&lt;\\/span&gt;&lt;\\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;odds for&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;[Team1]&lt;\\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;vs&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;[Team2]&lt;\\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;from top bookmakers on OddsPortal. Our real-time comparison tool helps you find the best value before the first serve, whether you&amp;rsquo;re backing the favorite or betting on an upset.&lt;\\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;&lt;p&gt;Taking place at the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;text-decoration: underline;\\&quot;&gt;[TournamentName]&lt;\\/span&gt;&lt;\\/strong&gt;, this clash brings together two high-level players with contrasting styles and recent form. Whether you&amp;rsquo;re backing a straight-sets win or a five-set thriller, we&amp;rsquo;ve got the data and odds to guide your decision.&lt;\\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;&lt;p&gt;You can explore betting markets like match winner, total games, set score, and more &amp;mdash; all powered by live comparisons from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;[Number of Bookmakers providing Odds for the specific Match] &lt;a href=\\&quot;\\/bookmakers\\/\\&quot;&gt;Bookmakers&lt;\\/a&gt;&lt;\\/strong&gt;. Use the \\&quot;+\\&quot; button to add selections to your coupon, or click directly on the odds to head to the bookmaker offering the top price.&lt;\\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;&lt;p&gt;Tennis bettors can also take advantage of live odds, updated alongside live scores throughout the match. Whether it&amp;rsquo;s a momentum shift or a crucial break, you&amp;rsquo;ll always be equipped to react in real time.&lt;\\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;&lt;p&gt;Sign up for free to make your own prediction and see how the OddsPortal community is betting, with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;[% Prediction for 1]&lt;\\/strong&gt; for&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong style=\\&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#039;Open Sans&#039;, &#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, sans-serif;\\&quot;&gt;[Team1]&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#039;Open Sans&#039;, &#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, sans-serif;\\&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;\\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[% Prediction for 2]&lt;\\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;[Team2]&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#039;Open Sans&#039;, &#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, sans-serif;\\&quot;&gt;. You can also set up OddsAlert to get notified the moment your desired odds are available.&lt;\\/span&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;&lt;p&gt;Dive into recent form with the last 10 matches for both players in this event, plus head-to-head results and closing odds. Our match facts offer additional stats and trends sourced from the bookmakers offering the sharpest lines.&lt;\\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;&lt;p&gt;From pre-match analysis to live action,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;text-decoration: underline;\\&quot;&gt;[Odds Portal]&lt;\\/span&gt;&lt;\\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;delivers the best tennis odds, trusted stats, and real-time bookmaker comparisons.&lt;\\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\\/p&gt;&quot;],&quot;eventOverviewH1Text&quot;:&quot;Djokovic Novak vs Lehecka Jiri -  Odds, Predictions and H2H Results&quot;}},&quot;pageH1&quot;:&quot;Djokovic N. - Lehecka J.&quot;,&quot;tournamnetDescription&quot;:&quot;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Australian Open Betting - Odds, Standings, Live Scores &amp;amp; More for [[Year]]&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/h1&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;For those of you that love the sport, you will be well aware of Australian Open, and this year you can enjoy it with OddsPortal who guarantee you get the best&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\\&quot;\\/tennis\\/\\&quot; target=\\&quot;_blank\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;noopener\\&quot;&gt;tennis odds&lt;\\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for several different markets. For those of you that don&#039;t know, the Australian Open features the most elite players in tennis each year, making intense competition every January in Melbourne as they battle it out to win the Norman Brookes Challenge Cup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;The first of four Grand Slam tournaments each year, the Australian Open is played on hard courts and will feature the likes of Jannik Sinner and Novak Djokovic, who will be looking to add to their tally of trophies down under, as well as names like Carlos Alcaraz, Daniil Medvedev, among others.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Through our platform, you can follow the Australian Open and make informed betting decisions with the help of results and standings for the [[Year]] Australian Open and historically. First and foremost though, you can consume the best odds through dynamic comparisons of all the leading online bookmakers we work with, enabling you to maximise profits betting on one of the biggest tournaments in all of tennis.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Australian Open Tennis Odds, Markets &amp;amp; Strategies&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Betting on the Australian Open provides you with various markets to wager on during the tournament either pre-match or in-play.&amp;nbsp;You can place simple bets on the match winner or set betting, all the way to correct score betting through OddsPortal, with the best Australian Open tennis odds available for each and every one of the options. Additionally, if there is someone you have a gut feeling on before the tournament starts, or even after their performances so far in the Grand Slam, you can also find Australian Open winner odds through our outrights.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Beware though, because as form builds for certain players, the Australian Open betting odds fluctuate throughout the competition. Also influenced by other factors like injuries, head-to-head records, and court conditions, it&#039;s important to keep up with the tournament and watch the Australian Open too, ensuring you are up-to-date with all of the important information.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Find out about some for the Australian Open betting markets you will find, and some strategies that you could input from a betting perspective for this year&#039;s men&#039;s tournament.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Australian Open Betting Markets&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/h3&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;There are several different markets available for Australian Open betting, and even for all tennis on our site. Pick a specific market or even cover a few different options from what is available below with Australlian Open tennis odds:&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;ul&gt;\\n&lt;li&gt;Match Winner (Inc. Set Betting)&lt;\\/li&gt;\\n&lt;li&gt;Handicap&lt;\\/li&gt;\\n&lt;li&gt;Over\\/Under&lt;\\/li&gt;\\n&lt;li&gt;Correct Score&lt;\\/li&gt;\\n&lt;\\/ul&gt;\\n&lt;h3&gt;Australian Open Betting Strategies&lt;\\/h3&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Developing a solid betting strategy is essential for Australian Open betting, and any sports betting for that matter. Something you can do through our pages is research player form, head-to-head records, and past performance at the event, and they will all help you to identify trends or&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\\&quot;\\/value-bets\\/\\&quot; target=\\&quot;_blank\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;noopener\\&quot;&gt;value bets&lt;\\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for the Men&#039;s Australian Open.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;For example, a trend which has featured over the years is how the hard courts of Melbourne Park tend to favour powerful baseline players, but surprises are always possible, making Australian Open tennis odds ever-changing with each year.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Additionally, there will certainly be occasions where online bookmakers are slow to update their odds where they may have offered too big of a price, meaning that monitoring Australian Open odds throughout the tournament can reveal more valuable betting opportunities or a way to spot&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\\&quot;\\/dropping-odds\\/\\&quot; target=\\&quot;_blank\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;noopener\\&quot;&gt;dropping odds&lt;\\/a&gt;.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;In general, it&#039;s pivotal you use statistics to drive your Australian Open betting, which makes sure you maximise your chances of winning in addition to our compared odds providing you with healthier profits than before.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Australian Open Matches, Draw &amp;amp; Bracket&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Australian Open matches are available with odds on our platform from the qualification stage all the way through until the final every single year. This ensures you don&#039;t miss a single second of the action, in addition to guaranteeing you the best odds through compared prices for every single market we have available.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;In the main tournament itself, all of the matches are covered over a two-week period, with a draw made at the beginning to decide each player&#039;s path and who they will play in the rounds following the first. This path to the final is laid out on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\\&quot;\\/tennis\\/australia\\/atp-australian-open\\/standings\\/\\&quot; target=\\&quot;_blank\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;noopener\\&quot;&gt;Australian Open standings&lt;\\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;page through a bracket, meaning you can easily see who is likely to be playing who in the next round.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;You can find all of the Australian Open matches for the [[Year]] tournament, but also previous editions dating back to 2009 thanks to the historical data we have available.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;We also provide odds comparisons for all of the other Grand Slams, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\\&quot;\\/tennis\\/usa\\/atp-us-open\\/\\&quot; target=\\&quot;_blank\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;noopener\\&quot;&gt;US Open&lt;\\/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\\&quot;\\/tennis\\/united-kingdom\\/atp-wimbledon\\/\\&quot; target=\\&quot;_blank\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;noopener\\&quot;&gt;Wimbledon&lt;\\/a&gt;, and the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\\&quot;\\/tennis\\/france\\/atp-french-open\\/\\&quot; target=\\&quot;_blank\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;noopener\\&quot;&gt;French Open&lt;\\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;on OddsPortal, in addiiton to many other tennis tournaments throughout the season.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Find out which Australian Open matches are upcoming with us and get the best odds for your chosen markets for every game that is played at the tournament.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Australian Open Results and Scores&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Staying updated with Australian Open results and scores is crucial to following the tournament from a betting perspective. It&#039;s one thing to be aware of a player winning, but discovering his pre-match odds, how convincingly he won set by set, and the other information we offer can all factor into finding betting opportunities.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Our Australian Open results tell you the full story, and as mentioned give you pre-match odds and even the breakdown of odds movement with our recommended&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\\&quot;\\/bookmakers\\/\\&quot; target=\\&quot;_blank\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;noopener\\&quot;&gt;online bookmakers&lt;\\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;too. This allows you to compare those odds with what is represented in the upcoming fixtures, and whether or not there is a value play.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;To see this clear illustration of all the odds, you just need to click on an individual match, which you can do for example by clicking on the Novak Djokovic 1-3 Jannik Sinner result from the 2024 semi-finals.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Discover our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\\&quot;\\/tennis\\/australia\\/atp-australian-open\\/results\\/\\&quot; target=\\&quot;_blank\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;noopener\\&quot;&gt;Australian Open results&lt;\\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;page today and utilise the odds available to find opportunities to bet on in future rounds for any market of your choice.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live Betting and Australian Open Scores&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Australian Open live score on OddsPortal update almost immediately and provide real-time insights, helping you to track player performances and make informed decisions even while matches are ongoing. Live betting is now more popular than ever, especially on tennis, with lots of different Australian Open odds available through an extensive list of markets in-play.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Ways in which you could take advantage of Australian Open tennis odds in-play could be by betting on a top player like Jannik Sinner if they fall one set behind and their price to win increases dramatically compared to pre-match. Or similarly, a match could be incredibly tight and worth a punt on the over for the total games market with it likely to go to the wire.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;You can find in-play odds for more tennis matches at other tournaments through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\\&quot;\\/inplay-odds\\/\\&quot; target=\\&quot;_blank\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;noopener\\&quot;&gt;live odds&lt;\\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;page, while you can also find plenty for other sports too.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find Betting Odds and More for the Australian Open &amp;amp; Other Sporting Events With OddsPortal&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;With a wide range of betting options available, from outright winner markets to live betting on individual matches, our platform provides plenty for Australian Open betting. Most importantly, we provide the best odds for Australian Open betting, as well as encouraging you to make confident decisions with the help of historical data at the tournament through results and standings too.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;For those of you that might be new to sports betting, you can claim any of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\\&quot;\\/bonus-offers\\/\\&quot; target=\\&quot;_blank\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;noopener\\&quot;&gt;bonus offers&lt;\\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;that can be used for Australian Open odds, another tennis tournament, or even another sport if you would prefer. Moreover, we have plenty of other tools that may be helpful in enhancing your betting experience, like our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\\&quot;\\/betting-apps\\/\\&quot; target=\\&quot;_blank\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;noopener\\&quot;&gt;betting apps&lt;\\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\\&quot;\\/bet-calculator\\/\\&quot; target=\\&quot;_blank\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;noopener\\&quot;&gt;bet calculator&lt;\\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;pages.&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Discover OddsPortal today and enjoy Australian Open tennis betting through following results and standings, as well as consuming the best odds for all sports and competitions across the world.&lt;\\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;updateScoreRequestBase&quot;:&quot;\\/feed\\/postmatch-score\\/&quot;,&quot;requestBasePreMatch&quot;:&quot;\\/match-event\\/&quot;,&quot;requestBaseOddsHistory&quot;:&quot;\\/match-event-history\\/&quot;,&quot;appUrl&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/www.oddsportal.com&quot;,&quot;oddsAlertDetail&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/www.oddsportal.com\\/ajax-top-predictions\\/friends\\/&quot;,&quot;newOddsApiTest&quot;:false,&quot;requestPreMatch&quot;:{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;\\/match-event\\/1-2-0ShOHpqe-3-2-yj63f.dat?_=&quot;,&quot;refresh&quot;:15000},&quot;updateScoreRequest&quot;:{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;\\/feed\\/postmatch-score\\/2-0ShOHpqe-yj63f.dat?_=&quot;,&quot;refresh&quot;:15000},&quot;tournamentGamesComponent&quot;:{&quot;componentInfo&quot;:{&quot;tournamentName&quot;:&quot;ATP Australian Open 2025&quot;,&quot;sportUrl&quot;:&quot;tennis&quot;,&quot;allLink&quot;:{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;\\/tennis\\/australia\\/atp-australian-open-2025\\/&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;All matches&quot;}}},&quot;requestMatchFacts&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/www.oddsportal.com\\/ajax-event-match-facts\\/0ShOHpqe\\/UFxNEUzj\\/&quot;,&quot;requestEventData&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/www.oddsportal.com\\/ajax-event-data\\/0ShOHpqe\\/0&quot;,&quot;requestLastResults&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/www.oddsportal.com\\/ajax-event-last-results\\/2\\/0ShOHpqe\\/&quot;,&quot;requestBettingExchanges&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/www.oddsportal.com\\/ajax-betting-exchanges\\/2-0ShOHpqe-3-2\\/&quot;}\" />\n    </div>\n    \n    \n                                                                <div class=\"flex-col flex-center bg-gray-light\">\n                                    <div id=\"zone-bottom_banner\"></div>\n                                    <div id=\"zone-bottom_banner_desktop\"></div>\n                                    <!-- <div id=\"zone-desktop_bottom_banner\"></div> -->\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex-col flex-center bg-gray-light\">\n                                    <div id=\"zone-left_menu\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </main>\n\n                        <aside class=\"hidden min-w-[335px] flex-col flex-grow-0 min-md:!flex pr-5 ml-3\">\n                            \n                            <div class=\"min-md:min-h-[150px]\">\n                                <responsive-component-renderer :width=\"1150\" >\n                                    <my-coupon />\n                                </responsive-component-renderer>\n                            </div>\n                            <div id=\"zone-right_side_banner\" class=\"flex justify-center\"></div>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"sticky top-0 z-[1] flex flex-col min-lg:!hidden items-center justify-center bg-gray-med_light mb-3\">\n                                <div id=\"zone-rights_side_banner_mobile\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            \n                            \n       \n        <!-- <div class=\"flex flex-col min-md:w-[315px] min-md:min-w-[315px] max-md:mb-5 min-md:max-w-xs max-md:pl-3 max-md:pr-3 m